# This directory stores the food YOLO ONNX model used by the camera scanner.
# Run the training pipeline to generate these files:
#   python training/train_yolo.py --epochs 100 --batch 16
#
# Files expected here after training:
#   food_yolo.onnx   - ONNX model (~6MB for yolov8n)
#   classes.json     - Class index→name mapping
